configureJobGroup(command)
    Place a pipeline stage into a distinct process group so signals reach its descendants.
signalJobGroup(command, signal) -> error
    Signal the entire job process group, reporting a missing or already-exited child.
configureTerminalIO(terminal) -> error
    Enable nonblocking terminal I/O so deadlines and close interrupt pending reads and writes.
resizeTerminal(terminal, columns, rows) -> error
    Set terminal dimensions through its live raw descriptor without resetting nonblocking I/O.
